Reading. With the root nearest the unperturbed state, every displacement of the wall restores (one -5 % case has no root
within +-3 in ln rho_w). he1.py's reported quasi-static entries for X_census / X_cap at log M_b >= 10.45 took a second root
about e^1 away and are not the local response. A negative d ln M_env / d ln rho_w (those same envelopes; density contrast
59-250) means they sit past the turnover of the share condition at fixed sigma, the analogue of a Bonnor-Ebert sphere beyond
its critical contrast (about 14). That points to a gravothermal instability of the envelope itself, which no gate here
grades. X_share envelopes have contrast 1.2-1.3 and d ln M / d ln rho near +0.93. kappa = 1/2 FITTED; not theory closed. Adopts nothing.
